{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"基础原理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"webhook-architecture-patterns","title":"Webhook 架构与模式","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/fundamentals/webhook-architecture-patterns","wordCount":1629,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"delivery-guarantee-retry","title":"投递保证与重试策略","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/fundamentals/delivery-guarantee-retry","wordCount":1414,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"webhook-security-verification","title":"Webhook 安全与签名验证","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/fundamentals/webhook-security-verification","wordCount":1512,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 基础原理\n\n本章建立 webhook 系统的架构心智模型。从推送（push）与轮询（poll）的本质区别出发，讨论事件通知的拓扑结构、投递语义的理论约束（为什么 exactly-once 不可能），以及保护通信双方的签名验证机制。\n\n三篇文档构成递进关系：先理解整体架构与拓扑选型，再掌握投递保证与重试策略的工程权衡，最后深入安全层面的签名验证实现。这些基础将在后续「Provider 侧」和「Consumer 侧」章节中反复应用。\n"}